{
  "date": "2026-10-28",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "中国平安公布今年1至9月业绩，营运利润多了8.3%",
  "title_en": "Ping An reports its January–September results, with operating profit 8.3% higher",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月28日，中国平安公布了2026年前三个季度的业绩。今年1月到9月，公司归属于股东的营运利润是1259.05亿元，比去年同期增长8.3%。",
      "en": "On October 28, Ping An announced its results for the first three quarters of 2026. From January to September this year, the operating profit attributable to shareholders was 125.905 billion yuan, up 8.3% from the same period last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "每股营运收益是7.23元，增长9.2%。到9月底，归属于股东的净资产是10443.66亿元，比年初多了4.4%。",
      "en": "Operating earnings per share were 7.23 yuan, up 9.2%. At the end of September, net assets attributable to shareholders were 1,044.366 billion yuan, 4.4% more than at the start of the year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "寿险及健康险业务的营运利润是872.38亿元，增长5.7%。平安产险的保费收入增长3.5%，综合成本率是95.6%，改善了1.4个百分点。",
      "en": "The life and health insurance business had an operating profit of 87.238 billion yuan, up 5.7%. Ping An Property & Casualty's premium income rose 3.5%, and its combined cost ratio was 95.6%, an improvement of 1.4 percentage points."
    },
    {
      "zh": "平安银行的营业收入增长2.4%，净利润增长2.2%。不良贷款是指还不上的贷款，该行的不良贷款率是1.05%。保险资金投资组合有6.83万亿元，比年初增长5.2%。",
      "en": "Ping An Bank's operating revenue rose 2.4% and its net profit rose 2.2%. Non-performing loans are loans that cannot be repaid, and the bank's non-performing loan ratio was 1.05%. The insurance fund investment portfolio stood at 6.83 trillion yuan, up 5.2% from the start of the year."
    }
  ],
